  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c63919abaed2f0c4aaed4bac458f1789, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level1FrogDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - 'Hello fellow mages. I''m glad to see you got past those enemies. Seems you may
    be a skilled bunch!




    (Press E to continue)'
  - Welcome to Duolon. The land of friendship, and rocks that weirdly look like mountians.
  - Although for millennia this land was known for working together to accomplish
    our goals, a new evil has started to gain the ear of certain mages...
  - "This evil makes them want to work individually! To be alone! They isolate themselves,
    cut off from unity! They feel anti-social! They whisper, \u2018I don\u2019t need
    anyone,\u2019 like it's strength."
  - Maybe your group can show these mages what can come by working together, and
    hopefully stop them from turning into goblins... It's quite ugly (I don't understand
    how they are still enticed to be evil).
  - However, you will likely want to grow your party. You know the power of friendship,
    right?
  summaryLine: Grow and work together to show those evil-doers your might.
